repository-code: "https://github.com/pantaleonfassbender-coder/Lepanto-and-the-war-for-Cyprus"
url: "https://lepanto-and-the-war-for-cyprus.netlify.app/"
abstract: >-
  A documentary apparatus for the war for Cyprus and the Holy League,
  1570-1573, built from public-domain sources carried in full or in whole
  sections, with the original beside a working English translation: the
  capitulations of the Holy League (1571); the Popes' documents after the
  victory (Pius V, Gregory XIII); Martinengo's report of the siege of
  Famagusta in Malim's English (1572); Contarini's Venetian history of the
  councils and the battle (1572) with its map of the bay; Herrera's Spanish
  account and song of victory (1572); the Ottoman historians Pecevi and
  Katip Celebi, transcribed by eye from the printed Ottoman text with
  transliteration; the separate peace of 1573 in its Venetian and Ottoman
  versions; Cervantes and Chesterton as reception. With a timeline, plates
  and a Compare page setting the sources side by side.
keywords:
